---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact — Coyote & Quill"
  description="Start a conversation with Coyote & Quill. We work with a small number of clients at a time."
>
  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="label">Contact</p>
      <h1>Start a conversation.</h1>
      <p>We work with a small number of clients at a time. If the fit looks right, the conversation is worth having.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact-grid">

        <div>
          <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">What to expect</p>
          <p>There's no sales funnel here. You send a message, we read it, and if there's a fit we schedule a direct conversation — no intermediaries, no intake forms, no 48-hour response windows.</p>
          <p>A good first message tells us: what you're trying to accomplish, where you're stuck, and what you've already tried. We'll take it from there.</p>

          <div style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <p class="label" style="margin-bottom: 16px;">Good fits</p>
            <ul style="list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;">
              <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                <span style="color: var(--coyote-orange); flex-shrink: 0;">→</span>
                <span>Mid-market organizations navigating AI adoption without a clear strategy</span>
              </li>
              <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                <span style="color: var(--coyote-orange); flex-shrink: 0;">→</span>
                <span>Founders building in healthcare, defense-adjacent, or regulated industries</span>
              </li>
              <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                <span style="color: var(--coyote-orange); flex-shrink: 0;">→</span>
                <span>Teams that want to build with AI themselves — not just buy another tool</span>
              </li>
              <li style="display: flex; gap: 10px;">
                <span style="color: var(--coyote-orange); flex-shrink: 0;">→</span>
                <span>DoD contractors and defense-adjacent companies with AI adoption requirements</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="highlight-box" style="margin-top: 40px;">
            <p>Coyote &amp; Quill does not discount below the floor that maintains quality of delivery. If budget is a constraint, say so upfront — we'd rather have that conversation early.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <form id="contact-form" action="https://formspree.io/f/mgobglyd" method="POST">
            {/* Honeypot — bots fill this; Formspree silently drops those submissions */}
            <input type="text" name="_gotcha" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" aria-hidden="true" style="position:absolute;left:-9999px" />
            <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New inquiry — coyoteandquill.com" />
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="name">Full Name</label>
              <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="email">Email Address</label>
              <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="organization">Organization</label>
              <input type="text" id="organization" name="organization" placeholder="Company or firm name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="service">Area of Interest</label>
              <select id="service" name="service">
                <option value="" disabled selected>Select a service line</option>
                <option value="ai-adoption">AI Implementation Strategy</option>
                <option value="vibe-coding">Vibe Coding Engagement</option>
                <option value="app-dev">Standardize & Govern</option>
                <option value="tracewell">TraceWell — Product Inquiry</option>
                <option value="other">Other / Not sure yet</option>
              </select>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="message">What are you trying to accomplish?</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what you're working on, where you're stuck, and what you've already tried." required></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%; justify-content: center;">
              Send Message
            </button>
            <p id="form-status" class="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
          </form>

          <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--slate-grey); text-align: center;">
            Prefer direct email?
            <a href="mailto:hello@coyoteandquill.com" style="color: var(--ice-blue);">hello@coyoteandquill.com</a>
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.6fr;
    gap: 64px;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .form-group {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--slate-grey);
  }

  input, textarea, select {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    border: 1px solid rgba(74,96,128,0.3);
    border-radius: 2px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    color: var(--ice-blue);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    width: 100%;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    outline: none;
  }

  input::placeholder, textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--slate-grey);
  }

  input:focus, textarea:focus, select:focus {
    border-color: var(--ice-blue);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(138, 170, 200, 0.35);
  }

  textarea {
    min-height: 140px;
    resize: vertical;
  }

  select option {
    background: var(--night-field);
  }

  .form-status {
    margin-top: 16px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  .form-status:empty {
    display: none;
  }

  .form-status.success {
    color: var(--ice-blue);
    border-left-color: var(--ice-blue);
  }

  .form-status.error {
    color: var(--coyote-orange);
    border-left-color: var(--coyote-orange);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 40px;
    }
  }
</style>
